1
00:00:00,074 --> 00:00:03,556
Seorang petani menemukan
batu aneh di depan rumahnya.

2
00:00:03,556 --> 00:00:04,670
Ternyata,

3
00:00:04,670 --> 00:00:07,187
di bawah tanahnya terkubur kepala firaun.

4
00:00:07,187 --> 00:00:09,434
Dia sedang menggarap kebun timun di Mesir.

5
00:00:09,434 --> 00:00:11,972
Dia bisa saja menyimpannya diam-diam.

6
00:00:11,972 --> 00:00:13,807
Tapi dia memilih lapor.

7
00:00:13,807 --> 00:00:15,162
Arkeolog menggali,

8
00:00:15,162 --> 00:00:17,474
dan menemukan kepala raksasa Ramses II,

9
00:00:17,474 --> 00:00:19,573
setinggi 1,6 meter!

10
00:00:19,573 --> 00:00:22,693
Patung utuhnya diperkirakan 8,5 meter.

11
00:00:22,693 --> 00:00:24,048
Balasan kejujurannya?

12
00:00:24,048 --> 00:00:26,490
Dia dan istrinya dihadiahi umrah.

13
00:00:26,490 --> 00:00:28,152
Kalau kamu yang menemukan...

14
00:00:28,152 --> 00:00:28,654
lapor,

15
00:00:28,654 --> 00:00:29,971
atau simpan?
